Selection túmọ̀ sí pé program ń yan ohun tí yóò ṣe gẹ́gẹ́ bí condition (àyẹ̀wò kan) ṣe rí. Condition jẹ́ true (òtítọ́) tàbí false (kì í ṣe òtítọ́).

mark = 72
if mark >= 70:
    print("Distinction")
elif mark >= 50:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Try again")

Èyí ń print (fi hàn lójú screen) Distinction. Python ń ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn condition ní títò wọn, ó sì ń mú block (àkójọ ìlà kóòdù) àkọ́kọ́ tó bá bá a mu nìkan ṣiṣẹ́. Àwọn àlàfo tó wà ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìlà, tí a ń pè ní indentation, ń fi àwọn ìlà tó jẹ́ ti block kọ̀ọ̀kan hàn. Àìsí indentation máa ń fa àṣìṣe ní Python.

Selection pụtara na program na-ahọrọ ihe ọ ga-eme dịka condition (ọnọdụ a na-enyocha) si dị. Condition bụ ma ọ bụ true (eziokwu) ma ọ bụ false (ụgha).

mark = 72
if mark >= 70:
    print("Distinction")
elif mark >= 50:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Try again")

Nke a na-ebipụta Distinction. Python na-enyocha conditions n’usoro ma na-arụ naanị block (otu akụkụ koodu) mbụ dabara. Oghere dị na mmalite ahịrị, nke a na-akpọ indentation, na-egosi ahịrị ndị dị na block ọ bụla. Enweghị indentation na-akpata njehie na Python.

Selection yana nufin shirin yana zaɓar abin da zai yi bisa wani condition (sharaɗi). Condition ko dai gaskiya ne (true) ko ƙarya ne (false).

mark = 72
if mark >= 70:
    print("Distinction")
elif mark >= 50:
    print("Pass")
else:
    print("Try again")

Wannan yana nuna Distinction a kan allo (print). Python yana duba conditions bisa jere kuma yana gudanar da block na farko da ya dace kawai. Sarari a farkon layi, wanda ake kira indentation, yana nuna waɗanne layuka ne na kowane block. Rashin indentation yana haifar da kuskure a Python.

Structured Query Language (SQL) is the common language for this. Consider this query on a table called Students:

SELECT Name, Mark
FROM Students
WHERE Mark >= 50
ORDER BY Mark DESC;

SELECT names the fields to show. FROM names the table. WHERE sets the condition. ORDER BY sorts the results, and DESC means largest first.

Other commands change data:

INSERT INTO Students (Name, Mark) VALUES ('Wanjiru', 68);
UPDATE Students SET Mark = 70 WHERE StudentID = 12;
DELETE FROM Students WHERE StudentID = 12;

Always use WHERE with UPDATE and DELETE. Without it, every record is changed or removed.

