Mgbe niile jiri WHERE mgbe ị na-eji UPDATE na DELETE. Ọ bụrụ na i jighị ya, a ga-agbanwe ma ọ bụ wepụ record ọ bụla.

Structured Query Language (SQL) shi ne harshen da aka saba amfani da shi don wannan. Ka duba wannan query (tambayar da ake yi wa database) a kan table mai suna Students:

SELECT Name, Mark
FROM Students
WHERE Mark >= 50
ORDER BY Mark DESC;

SELECT yana ambaton fields da za a nuna. FROM yana ambaton table. WHERE yana saita condition (sharaɗi). ORDER BY yana jera sakamako, DESC kuma yana nufin mafi girma da farko.

Wasu umarni suna canza data:

